      "content": "thanks for the advice. i'll try the ice pack now. u sure i'm fine though? it just feels way more intense than usual and i'm feeling a bit dizzy which is weird for my migraines. do u think it's safe to just wait it out if it doesn't go away with the ibuprofen?",
